            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.18 — Your member card</h3>
<ul>
<li>Every Pane member now gets a card of their own: a one-of-a-kind pattern and colors, your name, when you joined and your member number.</li>
<li>Make yours in Settings › Membership (new installs make it during the welcome) and watch it come to life. Hover over it and it tilts toward you.</li>
<li>Make a new design any time, or save your card as an image to share.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
