            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.17 — A real assistant</h3>
<ul>
<li>Pane now looks things up before it answers: it searches the web, reads the top pages (prices and dates included), and answers with sources you can click.</li>
<li>Ask it to "pull up the page" and it opens the right one — the venue or official seller for tickets.</li>
<li>Follow-up questions stay on topic.</li>
<li>New: use OpenAI for smarter answers. Add your API key in Settings › Assistant (it's kept in your Keychain), or keep the free, private on-device model.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
